[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4384.229, "timestamp": "01:13:04", "text": "非常简单的杂技动作，因为谁知道呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4386.55, "timestamp": "01:13:06", "text": "这会很有趣。好了，你安全了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4388.79, "timestamp": "01:13:08", "text": "艾瑞安很安全。你可以直接走上去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4391.59, "timestamp": "01:13:11", "text": "胸部，然后到另一边。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4397.51, "timestamp": "01:13:17", "text": "拿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4400.229, "timestamp": "01:13:20", "text": "好吧，我觉得爱莉安娜好像已经释怀了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4402.55, "timestamp": "01:13:22", "text": "这里。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4407.03, "timestamp": "01:13:27", "text": "我预料到了。我预料到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4409.91, "timestamp": "01:13:29", "text": "呃，你就像你想跳上去一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4411.59, "timestamp": "01:13:31", "text": "光盘掉到那边去了。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4412.87, "timestamp": "01:13:32", "text": "慢跑？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4414.149, "timestamp": "01:13:34", "text": "哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4417.43, "timestamp": "01:13:37", "text": "好的。好的。慢跑挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4418.79, "timestamp": "01:13:38", "text": "你可以站在圆盘上，也可以站在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4420.07, "timestamp": "01:13:40", "text": "另一边。哪一个？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4421.27, "timestamp": "01:13:41", "text": "想站起来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4423.83, "timestamp": "01:13:43", "text": "呃，另一边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4427.189, "timestamp": "01:13:47", "text": "好的。但我运动能力并不强。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4428.31, "timestamp": "01:13:48", "text": "所以，我这就把它移过去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4429.43, "timestamp": "01:13:49", "text": "暂时先在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4430.87, "timestamp": "01:13:50", "text": "腿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4433.51, "timestamp": "01:13:53", "text": "好的。好的。呃，当科技和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4436.95, "timestamp": "01:13:56", "text": "埃斯坦好像摔倒了，你注意到了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4438.79, "timestamp": "01:13:58", "text": "地面就像你摔倒了一样。我会"}]